[2026-05-31T13:33:54.156751] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'main.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 16, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 16, 'total_lines': 16, 'snippet': '"""\nThis is the main module to launch the ArXiv Query Tool.\n"""\n\nfrom arxiv_query_tool import ArxivQueryTool\n\ndef run():\n    tool = ArxivQueryTool()\n    query_params = "cat:cs.AI"\n    results = tool.query_arxiv(query_params)\n    \n    tool.print_results(results)\n    tool.save_results_to_csv(results, "arxiv_results.csv")\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    run()\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 359, 'modified_ts': 1780227055.7110336, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 638, 'arguments': {'path': 'main.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40, 'inline_line_numbers': False, 'encoding': 'auto', 'include_line_offsets': False}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0019969940185546875
